              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eEdit a part\u0027s core identity and settings.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eEdit and save\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eChange any field, then press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eSave\u003c/span\u003e. \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eDiscard\u003c/span\u003e reverts to the last saved values.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eDeprecate\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eDeprecate\u003c/span\u003e. This also deprecates the part\u0027s routes, BOMs, eligibility, and container config together, and is blocked while any LOT of the part is still active.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"border-top:1px solid #172238;margin:2px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#093240;border-left:5px solid #22A8CC;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;margin:4px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;padding-bottom:4px;\"\u003eTwo fields worth knowing\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eParts Per Basket\u003c/span\u003e is the standard pieces per basket \u0026ndash; one LOT, one LTT label, at Die Cast, Trim, and intermediate Machining. \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eDefault Sub-Lot Qty\u003c/span\u003e sets the default split size used at Machining OUT.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
